WS8856FLS commands. PDF WS8856FLS_InstructionManual_EN_v1.2 overrides AT_CommandTXT.
Format: name param1 param2 CR LF. No parameter = query. Space between name and parameter.

save                         save to flash, reply ok
clear                        factory reset, reply ok
help                         list commands
reset                        reboot now, reply OK
reset <sec>                  reboot after 1-3600 s
svrst                        save and reboot
clrst                        factory reset and reboot
param                        query role, state, name, mac, pan, ipv6, tx, cca, phy, udp
role                         net role:1 border, net role:2 router
netname <name>               set 1-32 chars. query: Network name:<name>
                             default name is Wi-SUN Network
pan <id>                     border only, 0x0001-0xfffe. router is fixed 0xffff
ip                           Ipv6 address:<local>(local) <global>(global)
mac                          query mac:<address>
mac <address>                set 64-bit mac. do not duplicate
udpopts <opt> <para>         opt: udp_port, broadcast, multicast, disp_source
udpopts                      query udp_port, broadcast, multicast, disp_source
udps <ipv6> <data>           UDP send, ASCII up to 1480
fstat                        state 1 ready, 2 auth, 3 FAN, 4 routing, 5 joined
chrate <rate>                50 100 150 200 300 kbps. class follows this, no class command
domain <id>                  1 NA, 2 JP, 3 EU, 7 BZ
chconfig                     query only: domain rate class chbase chspace chnum
+++                          enter passthrough
at_save                      save passthrough settings
at_dest <ipv6>               passthrough destination
exit                         leave passthrough
ping <ipv6> [len]            ICMP, default 40 bytes, max 1480
txpower <dbm>                query txpower:<power>, set range 14 to 20
cca <dbm>                    query CCA threshold:<dbm>, set range -60 to -100
connum                       border only, connected node count
conlist                      border only, connected ipv6 list
routpath <ipv6>              border only, path
neighbor                     current neighbors number:<num> then mac list
